  <data name="AboutTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>About</value></data>
  <data name="AboutCheckUpdates" xml:space="preserve"><value>Check for updates</value></data>
  <data name="AboutAutoUpdates" xml:space="preserve"><value>Install updates automatically</value></data>
  <data name="AboutAutoUpdatesNote" xml:space="preserve"><value>A downloaded update installs the next time SCSKiller starts or quits, never during a compile, an offline session or a game. Off: only Restart to update installs it.</value></data>
  <data name="AboutDownloadSource" xml:space="preserve"><value>Download source code</value></data>
  <data name="AboutDescription" xml:space="preserve"><value>Compiles your games' shaders into the graphics driver's cache ahead of time, so they don't stutter the first time you play them.</value></data>
  <data name="AboutLicenseLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>SCSKiller licence:</value></data>
  <data name="AboutLicenseText" xml:space="preserve"><value> GPL-3.0-or-later, with an additional permission for Oodle, the Windows App SDK and graphics driver libraries (LICENSE-EXCEPTION.txt)</value></data>
