  <data name="AboutRiskText" xml:space="preserve"><value>SCSKiller is provided as is, without warranty. It checks each game for anti-cheat before adding its recorder, but that check can miss one. You use it at your own risk, and its authors are not responsible for bans, crashes or lost data.</value></data>
